{"item":{"key":"moment:1298745","id":"1298745","kind":"moment","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"c782182a37eb4562669ac9f0"},"time":1621612800000,"text":"所以我的建议是大家不要太过独，偶尔还是要去跟别人交流交流，三人行必有我师嘛～//[at uid=1103231]@氧化咩[/at]：太懂了  去麻烦别人不如自己搞定","title":"","images":[],"cover":"","duration":"","views":0,"counts":{"commentCount":25,"likeCount":104,"bananaCount":120,"shareCount":0},"url":"https://m.acfun.cn/communityCircle/moment/1298745","timePrecision":"day","source":{"key":"moment:1298736","id":"1298736","kind":"moment","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"c782182a37eb4562669ac9f0"},"time":1621683062545,"text":"一体机的出发点是为了节省成本，或者是源于过于广泛的兴趣爱好。\n但一体机做久了有弊端，人会在自己越发熟练的方面养成惯性和渐渐孤僻，导致闭门造车和闭目塞听。如何平衡“试着依赖他人”和“不想给他人添麻烦”对我来讲，也是一个很复杂的课题。\n比如画画，自己来可以需要时即时搞定，但去找画师就要排单，这个等待的时间对于没有长远安排的人来说就很难熬。\n有时候事情太多了也想试着去让别人帮忙，但常常不知如何下口。想一想，其实可能也是社交懒人的惯性吧_(:3 ⌒ﾞ)_","title":"","images":[],"cover":"","duration":"","views":0,"counts":{"commentCount":95,"likeCount":208,"bananaCount":225,"shareCount":1},"url":"https://m.acfun.cn/communityCircle/moment/1298736"},"commentsPending":false,"archivedComments":21,"archivedRoots":10,"threads":{"443436540":{"pages":["comments/1298745/threads/443436540/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"443436540","root":"443436540","user":{"id":"12961787","name":"千璃Senri","avatar":"643a4108a8925a36627d10e3"},"text":"但是自己出作品的好处就是快！","time":1621825402663,"floor":11,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false}},"442315254":{"pages":["comments/1298745/threads/442315254/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"442315254","root":"442315254","user":{"id":"13098191","name":"十三馒头","avatar":"0c28ddc563336f7c1b4765a2"},"text":"帮助水姐社交从我做起，所以水姐能帮我做一下暑假作业么[emot=acfun,1989/]","time":1621689541624,"floor":9,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reporte